  ** interface to 32-bit integer MPI enabled **

DIRAC master    (b23n02) starts by allocating     1424000000 r*8 words (  10.610 GB) of memory
DIRAC nodes 1 to 7 starts by allocating          1424000000 r*8 words (  10.610 GB) of memory
DIRAC nodes 1 to 7 to allocate at most           2048000000 r*8 words (  15.259 GB) of memory
DIRAC master    (b23n02) to allocate at most      2048000000 r*8 words (  15.259 GB) of memory
 
Note: maximum allocatable memory for master+nodes can be set by -aw (MW)/-ag (GB) flags in pam
 
