!                                                                                                   
! This test calculates the CC energy with the X2C Hamiltonian                                       
!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
Water molecule. X2C Hamiltonian. CC energies.                                                       
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.4INDEX                                                                                             
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.X2C                                                                                                
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.SCF                                                                                                
.EXACC                                                                                              
*SCF                                                                                                
.CLOSED SHELL                                                                                       
4                                                                                                   
.OPEN SHELL                                                                                         
1                                                                                                   
1 / 2                                                                                               
.EVCCNV                                                                                             
1.0E-9                                                                                              
**MOLTRA                                                                                            
.ACTIVE                                                                                             
energy -1.0 0.5 0.00001                                                                             
.NO4IND                                                                                             
**EXACC                                                                                             
.OCCUPIED                                                                                           
2..3                                                                                                
.VIRTUAL                                                                                            
4..10                                                                                               
.OCC_BETA                                                                                           
2                                                                                                   
.VIR_BETA                                                                                           
3..10                                                                                               
.PRINT                                                                                              
4                                                                                                   
.LSHIFT                                                                                             
0.1D0                                                                                               
.EXATENSOR                                                                                          
**INTEGRALS                                                                                         
*READIN                                                                                             
.UNCONTRACT                                                                                         
*END OF                                                                                             
                                                                                                    


